#: ../folio-assistant-sci/processes/content/lean-docs-publish.bpmn:47
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Tool `lean-html-docs` (`adapters/paper/lean/lean-docs-build.sh --lake-root <pkg> --lib <Lib>`). Refuses while another lake/lean process holds `.lake/`, refuses over a restored tree with no traces, checks or restores the warm cache, enables the sentinel-commented doc-gen4 require for this build only, then `lake -R -Kenv=dev build <Lib>:docs`. Output: `<pkg>/.lake/build/doc`."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-sci/processes/content/lean-docs-publish.bpmn:64
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Tool `lean-render-publish` (`adapters/paper/lean/lean-render.ts --docs <render> --site <site>`). Copies the render to `<site>/lean/` without Lake's bookkeeping, marks doc-gen4's iframe navbar and `find/` redirect rail-declined, adds the layout shim, optionally prunes to the folio's modules, then runs `rail-standalone-pages.ts --foreign-site` over the whole site and checks every staged page."
msgstr ""

